      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so hard to get an appointment and it's way too expensive to go to the ER or anything right now. i look online and everyone says stretching is the best thing for sciatica and nerve issues. if i just do some very controlled, slow twists and maybe use a foam roller on my lower back, shouldn't that be safe enough? i don't want to do anything crazy, just something to relieve the pressure so i can sleep.",
